WEBVTT

00:10:28.582 --> 00:10:34.797
(Applause)

00:10:35.172 --> 00:10:37.049
Architecture that is not alien

00:10:37.091 --> 00:10:39.968
to the people who must build
and live in it.

00:10:40.719 --> 00:10:44.598
Architecture that by testing
and design is more resilient

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:47.101
as we prepare for harsher weather.

00:10:49.019 --> 00:10:51.522
Now, I've said a lot.

00:10:52.398 --> 00:10:53.565
But nothing ...

00:10:54.858 --> 00:10:58.445
Nothing prepares you
for the mental uncertainty

00:10:58.445 --> 00:11:04.243
of experiencing, and hopefully
living through, a hurricane.